│
■  A type checker is required for nuxt typecheck. Install one of the following:
│
│
●  vue-tsc:
│
│    pnpm add -D typescript vue-tsc
│
│
●  Golar (see https://golar.dev/languages/vue/):
│
│    pnpm add -D golar @golar/vue
│
│
●  Golar also requires a golar.config.ts file. One will be created automatically the first time Golar is used.
│
